     - `ProviderDialCommand`: `command: Literal["line.dial"] = "line.dial"`, `line_id: LineId`, `assignment_id: AssignmentId`, `lease_id: LeaseId`, `number: RedactedString`, `media_endpoint: str`, `media_token: MediaToken`.
