     - `ProviderHangupCommand`: `command: Literal["line.hangup"] = "line.hangup"`, `line_id: LineId`, `assignment_id: AssignmentId`, `lease_id: LeaseId`.
     - `ProviderSendDtmfCommand`: `command: Literal["line.send_dtmf"] = "line.send_dtmf"`, `line_id: LineId`, `assignment_id: AssignmentId`, `lease_id: LeaseId`, `digits: str`.
     - `ProviderRevokeCommand`: `command: Literal["line.revoke"] = "line.revoke"`, `line_id: LineId`, `assignment_id: AssignmentId`.
     - Объединить их в дискриминированный union: `ProviderCommand = Annotated[ProviderDialCommand | ProviderAnswerCommand | ProviderHangupCommand | ProviderSendDtmfCommand | ProviderRevokeCommand, Field(discriminator="command")]`.
