### Задача 3 [CRITICAL, Domain Modeling] — Разделить `ProviderBinding` и `LineAssignment`
- **Локация:** `src/phonebridge/domain/contract.py`, `docs/api-contract.md`, `docs/phone-bridge-service-design.md` (§4.2).
